   "end_sec": 4.189,
   "duration_sec": 4.189
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "バスで来ます。家は大学の近くです。大学へは徒歩で行きます。家から大学まで歩きます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D002-S01",
    "C07-D002-S02",
    "C07-D002-S03",
    "C07-D002-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 4.539,
   "end_sec": 11.305,
   "duration_sec": 6.766
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "ユーリ",
   "source_text": "パクさんは電車で来ますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D003-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 11.655,
   "end_sec": 13.376,
   "duration_sec": 1.721
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "はい、電車で来ます。駅は家の近くです。先生の家はどこですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D004-S01",
    "C07-D004-S02",
    "C07-D004-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 13.726,
   "end_sec": 18.462,
   "duration_sec": 4.736
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "ユーリ",
   "source_text": "家はセンターの近くです。車は使いません。歩きます。リンさんは今日、どこにいますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D005-S01",
    "C07-D005-S02",
    "C07-D005-S03",
    "C07-D005-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 18.812,
   "end_sec": 25.864,
   "duration_sec": 7.052
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "図書館にいます。土曜日、リンさんはいつも図書館で勉強します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D006-S01",
    "C07-D006-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 26.214,
   "end_sec": 30.59,
   "duration_sec": 4.376
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "こんにちは。先生、今、何時ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D007-S01",
    "C07-D007-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 30.94,
   "end_sec": 34.993,
   "duration_sec": 4.053
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "ユーリ",
   "source_text": "こんにちは。十一時半です。リンさんは午後、どこで勉強しますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D008-S01",
    "C07-D008-S02",
    "C07-D008-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 35.343,
   "end_sec": 40.48,
   "duration_sec": 5.137
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "図書館です。一時から四時まで、図書館で日本語を勉強します。マテオさんは？",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D009-S01",
    "C07-D009-S02",
    "C07-D009-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 40.83,
   "end_sec": 46.735,
   "duration_sec": 5.905
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "わたしは宿題があります。一時に図書館へ行きます。リンさんと一緒に勉強します。交通の地図を作ります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D010-S01",
    "C07-D010-S02",
    "C07-D010-S03",
    "C07-D010-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 47.085,
   "end_sec": 54.153,
   "duration_sec": 7.068
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "はい。図書館の入口に地図があります。わたしは一時にその前にいます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D011-S01",
    "C07-D011-S02",
    "C07-D011-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 54.503,
   "end_sec": 60.383,
   "duration_sec": 5.88
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい。一時に図書館の入口へ行きます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D012-S01",
    "C07-D012-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 60.733,
   "end_sec": 63.726,
   "duration_sec": 2.993
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "ユーリ",
   "source_text": "リンさんはどこで昼ご飯を食べますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D013-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 64.076,
   "end_sec": 66.543,
   "duration_sec": 2.467
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "公園で食べます。かばんの中にパンがあります。マテオさんは？",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D014-S01",
    "C07-D014-S02",
    "C07-D014-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 66.893,
   "end_sec": 71.677,
   "duration_sec": 4.784
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "公園で食べます。今、スーパーでパンを買います。水も買います。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D015-S01",
    "C07-D015-S02",
    "C07-D015-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 72.027,
   "end_sec": 76.479,
   "duration_sec": 4.452
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D016",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "わたしはお茶を買います。スーパーはどこですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D016-S01",
    "C07-D016-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 76.829,
   "end_sec": 80.516,
   "duration_sec": 3.687
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D017",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "駅の隣です。この地図を見ます。駅はここです。スーパーは駅の左です。川の西です。川の向こう側、東に公園があります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D017-S01",
    "C07-D017-S02",
    "C07-D017-S03",
    "C07-D017-S04",
    "C07-D017-S05",
    "C07-D017-S06"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 80.866,
   "end_sec": 90.979,
   "duration_sec": 10.113
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D018",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "わたしは今、駅へ行きます。出口の前にバス停があります。あの交差点には横断歩道もあります。信号は今、赤です。車が止まります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D018-S01",
    "C07-D018-S02",
    "C07-D018-S03",
    "C07-D018-S04",
    "C07-D018-S05"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 91.329,
   "end_sec": 101.266,
   "duration_sec": 9.937
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D035",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "信号の色は赤、黄色、青です。この図の青は交通の信号の色です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D035-S01",
    "C07-D035-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 101.616,
   "end_sec": 107.825,
   "duration_sec": 6.209
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D036",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "今、青です。車が進みます。公園へは、あの横断歩道で道路を渡りますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D036-S01",
    "C07-D036-S02",
    "C07-D036-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 108.175,
   "end_sec": 115.161,
   "duration_sec": 6.986
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D037",
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい。街角の地図にも公園があります。川の隣に散歩道があります。そこから公園へ向かいます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D037-S01",
    "C07-D037-S02",
    "C07-D037-S03",
    "C07-D037-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 115.511,
   "end_sec": 122.492,
   "duration_sec": 6.981
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D019",
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "パクさんは何時に家へ帰りますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D019-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 122.842,
   "end_sec": 124.953,
   "duration_sec": 2.111
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D020",
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "一時に電車で家へ帰ります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D020-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 125.303,
   "end_sec": 127.697,
   "duration_sec": 2.394
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D021",
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "すみません、もう一度お願いします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D021-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 128.047,
   "end_sec": 130.216,
   "duration_sec": 2.169
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D022",
   "turn_index": 24,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "一時に、電車で、家へ帰ります。昼ご飯は家で食べます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D022-S01",
    "C07-D022-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 130.566,
   "end_sec": 135.506,
   "duration_sec": 4.94
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D023",
   "turn_index": 25,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "パクさんは明日、働きますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D023-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 135.856,
   "end_sec": 138.344,
   "duration_sec": 2.488
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D024",
   "turn_index": 26,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "いいえ、日曜日は働きません。月曜日から金曜日まで会社で働きます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D024-S01",
    "C07-D024-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 138.694,
   "end_sec": 144.09,
   "duration_sec": 5.396
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D025",
   "turn_index": 27,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "アナンドさんは土曜日、何時から何時まで働きますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D025-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 144.44,
   "end_sec": 148.229,
   "duration_sec": 3.789
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D026",
   "turn_index": 28,
   "speaker": "パク",
   "source_text": "九時から五時までです。今日、アナンドさんは会社にいます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D026-S01",
    "C07-D026-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-assistant-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": true,
   "review_flags": [
    "clip_asr_difference",
    "low_ASR_text_match"
   ],
   "start_sec": 148.579,
   "end_sec": 151.979,
   "duration_sec": 3.4
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D027",
   "turn_index": 29,
   "speaker": "ユーリ",
   "source_text": "マテオさんは明日、センターに来ますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D027-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 152.329,
   "end_sec": 154.763,
   "duration_sec": 2.434
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D028",
   "turn_index": 30,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "いいえ、来ません。九時に起きます。午前、家で勉強します。午後、大学の友達と公園へ行きます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D028-S01",
    "C07-D028-S02",
    "C07-D028-S03",
    "C07-D028-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 155.113,
   "end_sec": 162.686,
   "duration_sec": 7.573
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D029",
   "turn_index": 31,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "わたしは明日、七時に起きます。朝、家で本を読みます。午後、図書館へ行きます。先生は？",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D029-S01",
    "C07-D029-S02",
    "C07-D029-S03",
    "C07-D029-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 163.036,
   "end_sec": 170.99,
   "duration_sec": 7.954
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D030",
   "turn_index": 32,
   "speaker": "ユーリ",
   "source_text": "わたしは明日、センターに来ません。家で日本の写真を見ます。夜、日本語の本を読みます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D030-S01",
    "C07-D030-S02",
    "C07-D030-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 171.34,
   "end_sec": 177.436,
   "duration_sec": 6.096
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D038",
   "turn_index": 33,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "午後、地図は何で作りますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D038-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 177.786,
   "end_sec": 180.341,
   "duration_sec": 2.555
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D039",
   "turn_index": 34,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "紙で作ります。ペンで駅の名前を書きます。市内の地下鉄も地図にあります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D039-S01",
    "C07-D039-S02",
    "C07-D039-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 180.691,
   "end_sec": 186.225,
   "duration_sec": 5.534
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D040",
   "turn_index": 35,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "説明は日本語で書きますか。飛行機の写真も使いますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D040-S01",
    "C07-D040-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 186.575,
   "end_sec": 191.332,
   "duration_sec": 4.757
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D041",
   "turn_index": 36,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "はい。写真を机に置きます。先生にも電話します。地図の説明はリンさんの番です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D041-S01",
    "C07-D041-S02",
    "C07-D041-S03",
    "C07-D041-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 191.682,
   "end_sec": 197.51,
   "duration_sec": 5.828
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C07-D031",
   "turn_index": 37,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "わたしは今、スーパーへ行きます。リンさんは？",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C07-D031-S01",
